ortions that forgive a long day. Nothing about them asks to be noticed. Everything about them is noticed."}</p><h2>{"Start with the shoulder"}</h2><p>{"Esmé Laurent’s blazer has no padding at all, only a light canvas at the chest, so the jacket sits on you rather than around you. Try it a size up, sleeves pushed back, over a fine knit instead of a shirt. That one change takes it from the office to dinner."}</p><ul><li><strong>{"The jacket:"}</strong>{" unpadded, long enough to cover the seat, one button."}</li><li><strong>{"The trouser:"}</strong>{" high rise, double pleat, a full leg that breaks once on the shoe."}</li><li><strong>{"The coat:"}</strong>{" longer than you think. Below the knee is the new mid-length."}</li></ul></div><section className={"grid items-center gap-10 mt-[clamp(3rem,2rem_+_3vw,5rem)] px-(--container-x) lg:gap-[clamp(3rem,2rem_+_4vw,6rem)] lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,5fr)_minmax(0,6fr)] lg:max-w-[calc(var(--container-max)_+_2_*_var(--container-x))] lg:mx-auto"}><figure><img className={"w-full aspect-[4/5] object-cover rounded-xl"} src={"https://draftmango.com/draftmango/assets/media/placeholder/852x1138.svg"} alt={"A woman in a relaxed chocolate brown wool suit with wide trousers"} width={"852"} height={"1139"} loading={"lazy"} decoding={"async"} /></figure><figure data-anim={"fade-up"}><blockquote className={"text-[clamp(1.75rem,1.3rem_+_1.6vw,2.75rem)] font-semibold leading-[1.15] tracking-[-0.035em] text-balance text-text"}>{"“A suit should feel like the coat you forgot you were wearing. If you notice it, I cut it wrong.”"}</blockquote><figcaption className={"mt-5 text-muted"}>{"Esmé Laurent, at her Paris studio"}</figcaption></figure></section><div className={"article-body custom-article pt-[clamp(3rem,2rem+3vw,5rem)]"}><h2>{"Then let the coat finish it"}</h2><p>{"Henrik Sol’s double-breasted overcoat is the piece the whole look hangs from. Six buttons, a peak lapel and a length that stops mid-calf: worn open, it falls in one straight line from the shoulder, which is what makes a softer suit underneath look deliberate."}</p><p>{"Colour is the last quiet thing. Grey on grey, navy over cream, chocolate with camel: two tones that sit close together, then one sharp thing, a polished derby or a cognac bag, to pull it into focus."}</p><blockquote className={"pt-7 pb-7 pl-0 text-center border-l-0"}>{"\n                        Buy the trouser that fits your hip and have the hem taken up. We do it for free, and it is the difference between a good suit and yours.\n                        "}<cite>{"Clara Ivarsson, Head of Styling"}</cite></blockquote></div><section className={"section overflow-x-clip"} aria-labelledby={"fs3-story-shop-title"}><div className={"container"}><div className={"custom-head"} data-anim={"fade-up"}><div><p className={"custom-kicker"}>{"Shop the Story"}</p><h2 id={"fs3-story-shop-title"} className={"custom-h2"}>{"Six pieces from the shoot"}</h2></div><div className={"flex gap-2"}><button type={"button"} className={"carousel-btn carousel-btn-prev"} aria-label={"Previous pieces"}><i className={"ph ph-arrow-left"} aria-hidden={"true"}></i></button><button type={"button"} className={"carousel-btn carousel-btn-next"} aria-label={"Next pieces"}><i className={"ph ph-arrow-right"} aria-hidden={"true"}></i></button></div></div><div className={"swiper"} data-speed={"600"} data-slides-per-view={"1.5"} data-space-between={"16"} data-breakpoints={"{\"640\":{\"slidesPerView\":2.5},\"1024\":{\"slidesPerView\":4,\"spaceBetween\":24}}"} data-lenis-prevent-touch={""}><ul className={"swiper-wrapper m-0 list-none p-0"}><li className={"product-card swiper-slide custom-card"} data-product={""} data-product_id={"fs3-s01"} data-cat={"women tailoring"} data-price={"980"} data-colours={"black"} data-sizes={"xs s m l xl"} data-brand={"esme-laurent"} data-sale={"no"} data-features={""} data-rating={"4.8"} data-stock={"in"} data-date={"2026-09-28"} data-pop={"88"} data-anim={"fade-up"} data-anim-delay={"0"}><div class